{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Abyssborne</strong> is a dark fantasy roguelite</h2><strong>Abyssborne</strong> thrusts you into a shadowed, ever-changing dungeon, teeming with enemies, upgrades, and untold power.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781190/extras/gif3.gif?t=1749568594\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Master Dynamic Combat</h2>Engage in fast-paced, reactive combat where every strike matters. Face a wide variety of unique enemies and grow stronger with each battle.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781190/extras/gif1.gif?t=1749568594\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Grow Stronger with Every Step</h2>Progress through the ever-changing dungeon, unlock new abilities, and evolve your playstyle. Each run brings you closer to mastering the darkness.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781190/extras/gif2.gif?t=1749568594\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Uncover the Secrets of the Abyss</h2>Progress deeper into the dungeon to piece together the cryptic story. Discover hidden letters and uncover the dark mysteries buried within the Abyss.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781190/extras/gif4.gif?t=1749568594\" />","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3781190?t=1749568594","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781190/248bfdefdabbb38d0a1bc0d99e788965406e3a04/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749568594","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781190/9cdd03a42152e29c8d7a7986b273bb2fb933d65d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749568594","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781190/9cdd03a42152e29c8d7a7986b273bb2fb933d65d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749568594","categories":